@* ============================================================================= *@
@* _ViewImports.cshtml — Global View Imports *@
@* ============================================================================= *@
@* This file is automatically included by the Razor engine for EVERY view in the *@
@* application. It sets up common @using directives and tag helpers so that *@
@* individual views don't need to repeat these imports. *@
@* ============================================================================= *@

@* Import the root namespace (for accessing classes like ErrorViewModel) *@
@using DevCoreBlog
@* Import the Models namespace so views can use @model ErrorViewModel, etc. *@
@* without writing the full namespace each time *@
@using DevCoreBlog.Models
@* Import the Core.Entities namespace so views can use @model Post, @model Category, etc. *@
@* These entities were moved from Models/ to Core/Entities/ as part of the N-Tier architecture *@
@using DevCoreBlog.Core.Entities
@* Enable ASP.NET Core Tag Helpers (asp-for, asp-action, asp-controller, etc.) *@
@* These allow Razor-like syntax in HTML attributes for form binding and URL generation *@
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
